msgstr "sandaletler"

#. [dummy]: id=sandals
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:341
msgid "This unit has 40% defense and full movement on water, swamp, and snow."
msgstr ""
"Bu birim suda, bataklıkta ve karda %40 savunmaya ve tam harekete sahiptir."

#. [dummy]: id=horn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:396
msgid "orc-horn"
msgstr "ork borusu"

#. [dummy]: id=horn
#. "ally" includes both the player's units and allied units. "living" excludes Delfador's elementals. When one ally dies, other allies gain the "regenerates" ability for one turn.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:398
msgid ""
"Whenever one living ally dies, all others gain regeneration for one turn."
msgstr ""
"Bir canlı müttefik öldüğünde diğerlerinin hepsi bir el boyunca yenilenme "
"kazanır."

#. [floating_text]
#. this is floating text, to be shown above a unit that's temporarily gained the "regeneration" ability
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:451
msgid "+regen"
msgstr "+yenilenme"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:486
msgid "Take heart, men! Rally and avenge the fallen!"
msgstr "Yüreklenin, adamlar! Toplanın ve düşenlerin intikamını alın!"

#. [object]: id=amulet
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:499
msgid "Artificer’s Amulet"
msgstr "Zanaatkârın Muskası"

#. [object]: id=amulet
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:500
msgid ""
"This oddly shaped talisman siphons energy from nearby magical items, healing "
"Konrad for 1 HP each turn. This value doubles (2, 4, 8, etc) for each other "
"magic item that Konrad wields."
msgstr ""
"Bu tuhaf biçimli tılsım yakındaki büyülü eşyalardan enerji emerek Konrad’ı "
"her el 1 YP iyileştirir. Bu değer Konrad’ın taşıdığı her diğer büyülü eşya "
"için iki katına çıkar (2, 4, 8 vb.)."

#. $magic_item_count controls gettext's plural selection. $regen will equal 2^$magic_item_count
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:546
msgid ""
"Konrad currently has 1 other magic item, and will heal himself $regen HP per "
"turn. If poisoned, he will remove the poison instead of healing."
msgid_plural ""
"Konrad currently has $magic_item_count other magic items, and will heal "
"himself $regen HP per turn. If poisoned, he will remove the poison instead "
"of healing."
msgstr[0] ""
"Konrad’ın şu an 1 başka büyülü eşyası var ve her el kendini $regen YP "
"iyileştirecek. Zehirlenirse iyileşmek yerine zehri temizleyecek."
msgstr[1] ""
"Konrad’ın şu an $magic_item_count başka büyülü eşyası var ve her el kendini "
"$regen YP iyileştirecek. Zehirlenirse iyileşmek yerine zehri temizleyecek."

#. [regenerate]: id=amulet_regen
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:568
msgid "artifice"
msgstr "zanaat"

#. [regenerate]: id=amulet_regen
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:569
msgid ""
"Regenerate 1 HP each turn. This value doubles (2, 4, 8, etc) for each other "
"magic item that Konrad wields."
msgstr ""
"Her el 1 YP yenile. Bu değer Konrad’ın taşıdığı her diğer büyülü eşya için "
"iki katına çıkar (2, 4, 8 vb.)."

